                                                "sense_id": "d9429d23-0bb9-33ec-829a-4f4d02297ea6",
                                                "text": "Grammage of paper is very important because all physical properties and many optical and electrical properties are affected by the change in grammage. Paper is sold by weight; therefore, the lowest grammage paper that will do the job is usually selected by the customer."
                                            }
                                        ]
